window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p><b>Alien abduction has never been this hot!</b><br> <br> 4 books. Hours of steamy sci-fi romance and gorgeous alpha aliens.<br> <br> Meet Torven, the falsely accused Inferno Force warrior who takes his tribute bride hostage to save his skin. Dakar, the galaxy's most notorious playboy who finally meets his match. Vox, the damaged part-cyborg who's been programmed to claim his mate by any means necessary. And don't miss the holiday magic when all six couples come together for a Christmas celebration that's more naughty than nice.<br> <br> As hot as the Drexian warriors are, not every woman wants an alien mate. But these warriors aren't used to being disobeyed—and they definitely aren't used to feisty human women who shoot first and ask questions later. Sparks will fly as these couples battle ice creatures, navigate alien bordellos, survive space station politics, and deck the halls with plenty of mistletoe mischief.</p> <p><i>Tribute Brides of the Drexian Warriors Collection Books 4-7 contains three full-length novels and one holiday novella (RANSOMED, FORBIDDEN, BOUND, and JINGLED). If you like enemies-to-lovers romance, star-crossed lovers, galactic action-adventure, and steamy abduction to love romance with a guaranteed HEA after and no cheating, you’ll love this three-book collection.</i></p>"; 
